    "When the agy CLI lets go of a chat you're viewing, so you can reply from here." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "عندما يترك agy CLI محادثة تعرضها، لتتمكن من الرد من هنا."
